@startuml

note as DiagramNote #FFFBCC
This is a first attempt at showing the use of HATPro
in a Hospitality and Travel leveraging a person AI Agent
delegated to by the Traveler "booking" cycle 
end note


!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle



actor Traveler
actor "AI Agent" as Agent


rectangle "HATPro Travel Profile" as HATPro {
[Identity & Contact]
[Preferences (Food, Accessibility, etc.)]
[Transport & Lodging Needs]
[Attractions Interests]
}


rectangle "Ecosystem" {
rectangle "Aggregators" {
[Booking.com Connected Trip]
[Other OTAs]
[Google Travel]
}
rectangle "Suppliers" {
[Airlines]
[Hotels]
[Attractions]
[Ground Transport]
}
}


Traveler --> Agent : Delegates control
Agent --> HATPro : Access structured profile


Agent --> [Booking.com Connected Trip] : Query / negotiate offers
Agent --> [Other OTAs] : Query / compare
Agent --> [Google Travel] : Query / compare
Agent --> [Airlines] : Direct query (as needed)
Agent --> [Hotels] : Direct query (as needed)
Agent --> [Attractions] : Direct query (as needed)
Agent --> [Ground Transport] : Direct query (as needed)


[Booking.com Connected Trip] --> [Airlines]
[Booking.com Connected Trip] --> [Hotels]
[Booking.com Connected Trip] --> [Attractions]
[Booking.com Connected Trip] --> [Ground Transport]


@enduml